# The rendered page is generated from jobs.json on every run, so it is output, not
# source. Python caches and .venv are already ignored by the repo root's .gitignore
# (unanchored, so they match here too) -- do not repeat them.
internships.html
# The store. Each machine that runs the scraper keeps its own; at a few megabytes a
# run it was too heavy to commit for a tool few people on the team run.
jobs.json
# The Jobs feed the backend serves, written beside the page from the same roles.
feed.json
